# Applied automatically by Vite for `vite build` (mode=production) — used for both the GitHub
# Pages CI build and any local build (including `npx cap sync android`). Without this, a local
# `npm run build` silently falls back to the http://localhost:8787 dev default (see .env.example),
# which is what shipped in the Android wrapper's first several builds and looked like a network/
# CORS bug rather than what it actually was: a wrong base URL.
VITE_API_BASE=https://ping-backend.colebeing.workers.dev
